3-8bd3-1e4c326c86ea.webp","imageBytes":14308},"bf2813871b88":{"id":"bf2813871b88","text":"What is Boxing Day?","source":"BTS 21 · #87","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/0ee6f132-eeb4-4706-9b61-b5286df01267.webp","imageBytes":27246},"1247efeb966d":{"id":"1247efeb966d","text":"On Halloween, children wear costumes.","source":"BTS 21 · #9","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/1fa368da-be56-4d67-a315-2313c0169ed6.webp","imageBytes":19798},"78fe5b22e8cc":{"id":"78fe5b22e8cc","text":"They go trick-or-treating in the neighborhood.","source":"BTS 21 · #10","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/b8415c43-cde4-42ca-84c6-51c979b4d983.webp","imageBytes":32184},"19b6a8d63269":{"id":"19b6a8d63269","text":"Thanksgiving is a time to be grateful.","source":"BTS 21 · #11","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/fd2d7957-7011-4baa-8a90-5360773b0d11.webp","imageBytes":32636},"6721ce98e9b6":{"id":"6721ce98e9b6","text":"What are you thankful for?","source":"BTS 21 · #12","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/e36f37bc-30e4-419e-9a18-1ab0c385bd01.webp","imageBytes":12028},"f646db43c4a7":{"id":"f646db43c4a7","text":"Yes, we sing carols together as a family.","source":"BTS 21 · #80","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/2427b5e2-b135-4d48-a61b-9c5676be5f1d.webp","imageBytes":26088},"ca4c48b9bb8e":{"id":"ca4c48b9bb8e","text":"Yes, I always give presents to my friends.","source":"BTS 21 · #15","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/363622de-a02f-4e9d-a231-f41baab5b3cc.webp","imageBytes":12502},"3cccf11f2c02":{"id":"3cccf11f2c02","text":"Do you give gifts on birthdays?","source":"BTS 21 · #14","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ef797d34-3adc-4c35-a38a-bdb2f7dd6607.webp","imageBytes":35432},"2b5b9f41c9f2":{"id":"2b5b9f41c9f2","text":"I'd be happy to help you.","source":"BTS 11 · #96","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/dd3b7716-69ab-4656-ab4f-c94d561ea996.webp","imageBytes":12500},"950d0362a99c":{"id":"950d0362a99c","text":"It was a wonderful experience.","source":"BTS 28 · #19","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/f7bf3be0-9910-40da-8770-fa45a226fd96.webp","imageBytes":19672},"c8c15d1bc122":{"id":"c8c15d1bc122","text":"You should go twice a year.","source":"BTS 22 · #64","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/5a609d5d-5fe6-414f-bce6-2056d00535f6.webp","imageBytes":37418},"ef4aa6ac57c8":{"id":"ef4aa6ac57c8","text":"We watch fireworks at midnight.","source":"BTS 21 · #18","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/317f89fd-cd7e-44d8-9859-183d323f600a.webp","imageBytes":16012,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/b011d0c0-b20e-4023-84d0-7a150821fd07.mp4","videoBytes":501386,"duration":5.875},"cca28144fc9e":{"id":"cca28144fc9e","text":"I attend weekly team meetings every Monday at ten o'clock.","source":"SIU Basic 3 · #64","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/e3968f80-e406-4b47-87f2-534c5f779a22.webp","imageBytes":11934},"37b78506dcf1":{"id":"37b78506dcf1","text":"India is known for its colorful festivals.","source":"BTS 28 · #100","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/279721e5-b822-49df-85f3-48c2f5d3f413.webp","imageBytes":44942},"ca562db41fe5":{"id":"ca562db41fe5","text":"Yes, I love going to the lantern festival.","source":"BTS 21 · #20","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/23c8a827-392d-4011-8040-547dd088ee6e.webp","imageBytes":15978},"4518ecb9e6e6":{"id":"4518ecb9e6e6","text":"What is Valentine's Day?","source":"BTS 21 · #21","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/7e42b2a6-2d8f-4e02-92d9-313b4ea1ce0f.webp","imageBytes":24216},"12de8c27b8d6":{"id":"12de8c27b8d6","text":"Playing sports or games together builds friendship.","source":"BTS 29 · #87","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/3f134b7d-026b-49a8-bbad-49bb352aca18.webp","imageBytes":43270,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/2febe08d-c3ef-4e48-9235-fd547f746dac.mp4","videoBytes":497763,"duration":5.875},"2405975c3791":{"id":"2405975c3791","text":"Email allows us to send messages instantly around the world.","source":"BTS 25 · #22","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/4c30ad44-49c9-4307-bc41-85cab733ec18.webp","imageBytes":8614},"c5c360e90f57":{"id":"c5c360e90f57","text":"Paying back credit cards is important.","source":"BTS 29 · #54","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/27c1fb65-019a-4ff4-98ba-9bc7fa17fc6b.webp","imageBytes":10908},"e61981dfe353":{"id":"e61981dfe353","text":"My mother's name is Mary.","source":"BTS 3 · #21","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/82f49140-8f10-4902-ab5a-fa845a8bb29a.webp","imageBytes":18974},"5bc28517ba43":{"id":"5bc28517ba43","text":"We give gifts and flowers to our mothers.","source":"BTS 21 · #26","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/79e6b2b8-2a26-4d14-9f68-1a0054b9f4ce.webp","imageBytes":19424},"f3b0aa954865":{"id":"f3b0aa954865","text":"Father's Day is when we celebrate our dads.","source":"BTS 21 · #27","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/5eca42a0-9ea7-4fc4-bb68-1e0cf9e557eb.webp","imageBytes":26244},"5d4704aab8eb":{"id":"5d4704aab8eb","text":"July is usually the hottest.","source":"BTS 10 · #64","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.